Untitled UI PRO
---------------
The browser interface of this product includes individual components from
Untitled UI React PRO, used under the Untitled UI licence
(https://www.untitledui.com/license). They are part of this end product,
restyled and adapted for it; they are not distributed as a UI kit or library,
and only the components the browser uses are included (decided by Simtabi
LLC, 2026-11-12). Their source lives under:

- resources/js/components/application/command-menus
- resources/js/components/application/modal-layouts
- resources/js/components/application/notifications
- resources/js/components/application/tree-view
- resources/js/components/shared-assets

and each file opens with a comment saying so. They are also compiled into:

- public/assets/js/inertia-app.js and the chunks beside it, and
  public/assets/css/inertia-app.css (the committed browser bundle, published
  to host applications)
- resources/vendor/react-icon-browser (the earlier vendored library build,
  deprecated and no longer built)

The Untitled UI licence does not permit redistributing these components on
their own, or as a kit or library. Taking them out of this product, or using
them in another, needs your own Untitled UI licence.

